{
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.8.0",
  "exporter": {
    "name": "Camunda Web Modeler",
    "version": "7b5e780"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 19,
  "id": "form_risk_assessment",
  "components": [
    {
      "text": "## 📋 Informations CAPA",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header0",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_CAPA_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "**Numéro CAPA:** {{capaNumber}}\n\n**Titre:** {{capaTitle}}\n\n**Département:** {{department}}\n\n**Priorité:** {{priority}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_CAPA_Info",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_CAPA_Info"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep1",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep1"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 📝 Résumé du plan d'actions",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header1",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Plan_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 1\n\n**Type:** {{action1Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action1Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{action1Owner}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action1Deadline}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action1_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action1_Summary"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 2\n\n**Type:** {{action2Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action2Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{action2Owner}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action2Deadline}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action2_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action2_Summary",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action2Description = null or action2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 3\n\n**Type:** {{action3Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action3Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{action3Owner}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action3Deadline}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action3_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action3_Summary",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action3Description = null or action3Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep2"
    },
    {
      "text": "## ⚠️ Évaluation des risques associés aux actions",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "Évaluez les risques potentiels liés à la mise en œuvre de chaque action du plan. Considérez les risques opérationnels, financiers, humains, techniques, et de conformité.",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Instructions",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Instructions"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Évaluation Action 1",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk1_Header"
    },
    {
      "label": "Risques identifiés pour l'Action 1",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Description",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Risk1_Description",
      "key": "risk1Description",
      "validate": {
        "required": true,
        "minLength": 10
      },
      "description": "Listez les risques potentiels (sécurité, qualité, coûts, délais, résistance au changement, etc.)",
      "rows": 4
    },
    {
      "label": "Probabilité d'occurrence",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "1 - Très faible (< 10%)",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2 - Faible (10-30%)",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3 - Moyenne (30-50%)",
          "value": "3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4 - Élevée (50-80%)",
          "value": "4"
        },
        {
          "label": "5 - Très élevée (> 80%)",
          "value": "5"
        }
      ],
      "type": "select",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Probability",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Risk1_Probability",
      "key": "risk1Probability",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "label": "Gravité de l'impact",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "1 - Négligeable",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2 - Mineure",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3 - Modérée",
          "value": "3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4 - Majeure",
          "value": "4"
        },
        {
          "label": "5 - Catastrophique",
          "value": "5"
        }
      ],
      "type": "select",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Severity",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Risk1_Severity",
      "key": "risk1Severity",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "label": "Mesures de mitigation",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk1_Mitigation",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Risk1_Mitigation",
      "key": "risk1Mitigation",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "description": "Actions pour réduire ou éliminer ces risques",
      "rows": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "### Évaluation Action 2",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk2_Header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk2_Header",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action2Description = null or action2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Risques identifiés pour l'Action 2",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk2_Description",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Risk2_Description",
      "key": "risk2Description",
      "description": "Listez les risques potentiels",
      "rows": 4,
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action2Description = null or action2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Probabilité d'occurrence",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "1 - Très faible (< 10%)",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2 - Faible (10-30%)",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3 - Moyenne (30-50%)",
          "value": "3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4 - Élevée (50-80%)",
